@luzechao/sim-engine-wasm

This package bundles, in WebAssembly form, EnergyPlus version 26.2.0 software and files derived from it:

  assets/libenergyplusapi.so   EnergyPlus version 26.2.0 software, compiled with Emscripten 5.0.3 as a
                               dynamically loadable module for Pyodide 314.0.x. Built from upstream commit
                               4bd7a1f26fb749a83257855aba6760e26c8a3c8f with the build and portability
                               patches published at https://github.com/luzechao/browser-energy-simulation
                               (patches/energyplus/0005 and patches/energyplus-pyodide). None of the patches
                               changes simulation algorithms.
  assets/pyenergyplus/         The Python API distributed with EnergyPlus version 26.2.0 software, with one
                               line added so it can locate the module under Pyodide.

